  "notes": "Cash basis county, governmental funds only. Statement lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (p4); beginning/ending cash are the cash basis fund balances the statement rolls forward (equal to cash, p3). No debt proceeds. Taxes 6,976,374 kept as one line (no printed breakdown by tax type on the statements); in detail the Inheritance Fund's Taxes 405,962 are inheritance tax by fund name. Balance sheet from the governmental funds Statement of Cash Basis Assets and Fund Balances (p3), totals equal the Statement of Net Position (p1). Detail: General Fund budget schedule (pp5-6, departments not itemized), Road & Bridge, Inheritance and COVID ARPA budget schedules (pp7-8); ARPA disbursements 2,500 are Public Safety per p4. Nonmajor funds: the combining statement has 14 fund columns (pp12-14), so its Total Nonmajor Funds column is used; the one-line per-fund nonmajor budget schedules (pp9-11) are not recorded to avoid double counting. Read pages 1-14 of 14"
